        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties present Kelly Hudson Properties present this spacious 2 Bedroom ground floor apartment to the market.\r\n\r\nClonmullen Hall is a modern residential development of apartments in a very central location in Edenderry. Just a short walk from the town centre, schools, churches, bank, post office and superb shopping to include Tesco, Aldi, Lidl & Dunnes Shopping Centre.\r\n\r\nEdenderry has developed into an ideal commuter destination with a good road infrastructure including bus routes to Dublin and Tullamore available from the Main Street. The M4 Motorway access is just 20mins drive away. The town has a wealth of amenities for the sporting enthusiast with rugby, GAA, fishing, soccer & a choice of two golf course just to mention a few.\r\n \r\nThe property was built in 2004 containing c.69.26sqm. (c.745.50 sq.ft.) of accommodation .This is an ideal starter home or investment opportunity\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\n\r\nHallway: \tc.1.67m x c.1.52m, Light fitting, ceramic tiles\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining: Ceramic tiles & wooden floor, light fitting, fully fitted kitchen, tiled splash back area, area fully plumber, hob, oven,  extractor fan, washing machine, tumble dryer, breakfast bar.\r\n\r\n\r\nSitting Room:\tCoving, light fitting, featured fireplace with a wrought iron insert & polished hearth electric fire, TV point, wooden floor\r\n\r\nBathroom: Tiled floor, tiled surround, power shower,  extractor fan, WHB, WC, heated towel rail\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: Light fitting wooden floor & TV point, doors leading to garden\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: Light fitting, Wooden floor, TV Point, fitted wardrobe, doors leading to garden\r\n\r\nInternal Features:\r\nWired for alarmed\r\nComposite hall door\r\nCurtains, blinds and light fittings included\r\nSatellite TV\r\nPhone Landline\r\nElectric  storage heating\r\nApprox c.69.26 sqms  (C.745.50sq ft)\r\nApprox 22 years old\r\nManagement Fee c. €1,400 per annum\r\n\r\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\r\n\r\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding  that all negotiations are conducted  through them. Every care is \r\ntaken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. \t\r\n\r\nLicence No:001492\r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n                                                \r\n\r\nExternal Features:\r\n\r\nDouble glazed PVC Windows\r\nLocated in quite cul-de –sac\r\nNot overlooked\r\nOne allocated car parking space\r\nMains Water\r\nMains Sewage\r\nBack Garden orientation– East"
      },
